WEBVTT

00:05:56.173 --> 00:06:01.144
and the larva of this parasite
will eat the aphid from the inside.

00:06:01.168 --> 00:06:02.219
(Laughter)

00:06:02.243 --> 00:06:04.487
This is all natural. This is all natural.

00:06:04.511 --> 00:06:06.510
This is not fiction, nothing at all.

00:06:06.534 --> 00:06:09.485
Again -- in your backyard.
In your backyard.

00:06:09.509 --> 00:06:11.014
(Laughter)

00:06:11.038 --> 00:06:12.503
(Applause)

00:06:12.527 --> 00:06:18.984
But this is the end result: mummies.

00:06:19.094 --> 00:06:24.276
This is the visual result
of a dead aphid encompassing inside,

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:30.195
a developing parasitoid that,
after a few minutes, you see halfway out.